# What `vercel deploy` from a laptop must not upload (Git deploys only see committed files).
# Vercel also applies this file to Git deploys of every project in the repo, so `frontend` must
# not be listed: aidflow-web builds from it. The API's function bundle leaves it out via vercel.json.
.env
.env.local
.venv
**/__pycache__
.vercel
data
contracts
docs
scripts
ml/data
